size:10.5pt\">4．（6分）阅读下面古诗文，回答问题。</span></p><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #555;padding:6px;vertical-align:top\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">[</span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">甲</span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">]</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">书李世南所画秋景二首（其一）</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">苏轼</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">野水参差落涨痕，疏林欹</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;font-size:12.0pt\"><sup>①</sup></span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">倒出霜根。</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">扁舟一棹归何处？</span><span style=\"text-decoration-line:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">家在江南黄叶村</span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">。</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #555;padding:6px;vertical-align:top\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">[</span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">乙</span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">]</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">题林居高士图（其三）</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">恽寿平</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">竹外空翠来，</span><span style=\"text-decoration-line:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">树杪</span><span style=\"text-decoration-line:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;font-family:Calibri;font-size:12.0pt\"><sup>②</sup></span><span style=\"text-decoration-line:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">泉声过</span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">。</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">眇然</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;font-size:12.0pt\"><sup>③</sup></span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">而遗世人，横琴向山坐。</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">注：</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;font-size:10.5pt\">①</span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">（欹）倾斜。</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;font-size:10.5pt\">②</span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">（杪）树梢。</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;font-size:10.5pt\">③</span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">（眇然）高远的样子。</span></p>","parts":[{"key":"01","section":null,"header":"","ids":["SJZ-AFCF7DABDB44#01"]},{"key":"02","section":null,"header":"","ids":["SJZ-AFCF7DABDB44#02"]},{"key":"03","section":null,"header":"","ids":["SJZ-AFCF7DABDB44#03"]}],"sections":[]},"searchText":"4．（6分）阅读下面古诗文，回答问题。[甲]书李世南所画秋景二首（其一）苏轼野水参差落涨痕，疏林欹①倒出霜根。扁舟一棹归何处？家在江南黄叶村。[乙]题林居高士图（其三）恽寿平竹外空翠来，树杪②泉声过。眇然③而遗世人，横琴向山坐。注：①（欹）倾斜。②（杪）树梢。③（眇然）高远的样子。\n（1）甲诗第二句中 　     　 和 　     　 两个词语呈现了画中秋日之景。\n（2）分门别类辑古诗，乙诗能和陶渊明的《饮酒》（其五）辑录为一类吗？请写出理由。\n（3）题画诗往往由画中写到画外，请从两首诗的画线句中选择一句进行分析。","sourceVersionRef":"dee7f5512ba75bf8c413","contentHistory":[{"ref":"5c0069f4ddeddbe3239a","date":"2026-10-30","reason":"本批提取/来源定位版本"},{"ref":"a31f520036dc444e0729","date":"2026-10-30","reason":"本批提取/来源定位版本"}],"qualityAudit":{"previousAnswerStatus":"所供解析答案已逐问挂接（非官方终审）"}},"questions":{"SJZ-AFCF7DABDB44#01":{"summary":"（1）甲诗第二句中 　     　 和 　     　 两个词语呈现了画中秋日之景。","sourceExcerpt":"（1）甲诗第二句中 　     　 和 　     　 两个词语呈现了画中秋日之景。","reason":"原二级“诗句信息定位”归并为新二级“诗句信息定位”","block":2